@@ -0,0 +1,6 @@
+  o Minor features (metrics port, relay):
+    - Count onion service descriptor fetches and uploads on HSDirs by
+      outcome, as tor_relay_hsdir_get_total and tor_relay_hsdir_post_total.
+      Uploads that are valid but not newer than the cached descriptor, which
+      happens without any fault when several instances publish for the same
+      address, are counted apart from invalid ones. Part of ticket 41339.
